  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "As reported by Jürgen Jakobitsch on Slack, when you create an IndirectContainer and use a hash URI resource the ldp:membershipResource, no triples are generated when they should be.  Here is a simple shell script to demonstrate this:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://gist.github.com/escowles/4e6f2a821c4ceb541ad6aca35148081c"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://gist.github.com/escowles/4e6f2a821c4ceb541ad6aca35148081c",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The output at the end should include a triple with <#me> as the subject, but it does not.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
